I was going to give a random priestess 400 x my level in gold to get
an AC bonus.  Well, as soon as I #chatted I realized I had gone up to
level 12 and had only around 4738 gold.  I gave it all to her to see
what would happen.  She says, "I bestow on thee a blessing."  Next thing
I know the corridors are mapping out around me at random intervals
the way they do when you're carrying the Amulet.

This has never happened to me before and was quite unexpected.  But
I can't say I'm displeased with this new ability!  Makes exploring
a tad bit easier . . .  I'll have to look at my intrinsics when I
die (or get a potion of enlightenment) and see if it's listed as
an intrinsic.

